<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB wins S.Korea nuclear order.</title>
<headline>ABB wins S.Korea nuclear order.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABB Asia Brown Boveri said it had received a South Korean order worth $200 million to equip two units of a nuclear power plant.</p>
<p>ABB said the order was placed by the state-owned electrical utility Korea Electric Power Company (KEPCO) for equipment for units five and six of the Ulchin Nuclear Power Plant.</p>
